{"reviewId": "66920859_84hT88c8R", "review": {"abstract": "伯纳姆说：“无论在何处，工业化的起飞阶段，无论是由资本家还是人民代表来管理，都会是一个残忍和剥削的过程。”事实上，起飞的本质就是要保证财富向少数人手中集中以完成原始积累的过程和进行再投资", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "chapterUid": 10, "content": "这就有点矫情了，农民之所以愿意进城打工，还是觉得打工的生活比种地强。欧美也是这样。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "7431-7524", "createTime": 1761823415, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 10, "reviewId": "66920859_84hT88c8R", "userVid": 66920859, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "author": {"userVid": 66920859, "name": "大河奔流", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAyb83YJgia42gDZWpgSJujHsyADgwcd65Rre6WNVEH63maBQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一个人的判断能力受限于他的认知范围", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "不要跟蠢货讲道理！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "commentsCount": 16, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "没得选+付出得到不匹配", "reviewId": "66920859_84hT88c8R", "commentId": "66920859_84hT88c8R_c36477278_8c2hUzbjW", "userVid": 36477278, "createTime": 1789110230, "author": {"userVid": 36477278, "name": "Jenny", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJO9VVcgUvN8cHx2f0Cx4VWkBHIWAVdeqia4wqVuYzIhYgIysOslJrUibWxTPsE1fWj8whV7NMHSa8w/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDee