t": "有剪刀差的时候农民能去城市？", "reviewId": "66920859_84hT88c8R", "toCommentId": "66920859_84hT88c8R_c439940589_86Q8w0jXj", "toUserVid": 439940589, "commentId": "66920859_84hT88c8R_c66920859_86QaAhQSV", "userVid": 66920859, "createTime": 1770813842, "author": {"userVid": 66920859, "name": "大河奔流", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAyb83YJgia42gDZWpgSJujHsyADgwcd65Rre6WNVEH63maBQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一个人的判断能力受限于他的认知范围", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "不要跟蠢货讲道理！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 439940589, "name": "飘", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-MN050ybswvrysqjBPvubIfb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-90", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 90}}}, {"reviewId": "66920859_84hT88c8R", "content": "因为剪刀差，所以农民很难致富，所以只能去城市", "toUserVid": 66920859, "toCommentId": "66920859_84hT88c8R_c66920859_86QaAhQSV", "commentId": "66920859_84hT88c8R_c439940589_86RB8zl1K", "userVid": 439940589, "createTime": 1770894969, "author": {"userVid": 439940589, "name": "飘", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-MN050ybswvrysqjBPvubIfb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-90", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 90}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 66920859, "name": "大河奔流", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAyb83YJgia42gDZWpgSJujHsyADgwcd65Rre6WNVEH63maBQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一个人的判断能力受限于他的认知范围", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "不要跟蠢货讲道理！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, {"content": "你到底懂不懂？有剪刀差的年代，农民是不准进城的，单位的人出差都得有介绍信。而且那时候没有民营企业，也没有雇工，农民进城能干嘛？", "reviewId": "66920859_84hT88c8R", "toCommentId": "66920859_84hT88c8R_c439940589_86RB8zl1K", "toUserVid": 439940589, "commentId": "66920859_84hT88c8R_c66920859_86RS2YSJV", "userVid": 66920859, "createTime": 1770910460, "author": {"userVid": 66920859, "name": "大河奔流", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAyb83YJgia42gDZWpgSJujHsyADgwcd65Rre6WNVEH63maBQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一个人的判断能力受限于他的认知范围", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "不要跟蠢货讲道理！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 439940589, "name": "飘", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-MN050ybswvrysqjBPvubIfb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-90", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 90}}}, {"reviewId": "66920859_84hT88c8R", "content": " 我的意思是：正是因为前三十年长期的“剪刀差”抽血，导致了农村基础设施落后、农民极度贫困，形成了巨大的城乡发展势差。等到80年代以后，包产到户解放了农业生产力，产生了大量农村剩余劳动力；同时城市开始发展商品经济，需要廉价劳动力。此时，面对长期的结构性贫困，进城务工确实成了农民想要改变命运、获取更高收入的“唯一现实选择”。你说农民进城是因为“觉得打工比种地强”，这在表象上是自由市场选择，但从宏观历史来看，这种“强”是建立在前期农村被系统性牺牲的基础之上的。", "toUserVid": 66920859, "toCommentId": "66920859_84hT88c8R_c66920859_86RS2YSJV", "commentId": "66920859_84hT88c8R_c439940589_86SYMNwi8", "userVid": 439940589, "createTime": 1770973434, "likesCount": 1, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 439940589, "name": "飘", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-MN050ybswvrysqjBPvubIfb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-90", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 90}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 66920859, "name": "大河奔流", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAyb83YJgia42gDZWpgSJujHsyADgwcd65Rre6WNVEH63maBQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一个人的判断能力受限于他的认知范围", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "不要跟蠢货讲道理！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, {"content": "城市化进程是全球性的，这个过程中农民涌入城市是必然的。即便是农业高度发达的英美法国，政府也是要大量补贴农民的。参考纪录片《克拉克森农场》。", "reviewId": "66920859_84hT88c8R", "toCommentId": "66920859_84hT88c8R_c439940589_86SYMNwi8", "toUserVid": 439940589, "commentId": "66920859_84hT88c8R_c66920859_86TUQn9RF", "userVid": 66920859, "createTime": 1771026623, "author": {"userVid": 66920859, "name": "大河奔流", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAyb83YJgia42gDZWpgSJujHsyADgwcd65Rre6WNVEH63maBQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一个人的判断能力受限于他的认知范围", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "不要跟蠢货讲道理！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 439940589, "name": "飘", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-MN050ybswvrysqjBPvubIfb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-90", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 90}}}, {"reviewId": "66920859_84hT88c8R", "content": "你根本就没听懂我的意思，算了", "toUserVid": 66920859, "toCommentId": "66920859_84hT88c8R_c66920859_86RS2YSJV", "commentId": "66920859_84hT88c8R_c439940589_86SYvnyqa", "userVid": 439940589, "createTime": 1770973177, "author": {"userVid": 439940589, "name": "飘", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-MN050ybswvrysqjBPvubIfb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-90", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 90}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 66920859, "name": "大河奔流", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAyb83YJgia42gDZWpgSJujHsyADgwcd65Rre6WNVEH63maBQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一个人的判断能力受限于他的认知范围", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "不要跟蠢货讲道理！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, {"content": "你说的很对。享受过城市生活的便利，没几个愿意回到过去。但是在工作，有几个能在工作地安居乐业的，房产就在那里，他们为什么不买，这是个人的不努力，还是国家的不努力？中国，乃至全球的经济现状，根本上应该还是需求的不足，生产过剩。应该说资本的所得利润再投资扩大生产的速度，大于人民财富购买力增加的速度，分配不公的问题肯定是有的，其实作为个人，更应该还是提升个人，积累财富，创造财富，怨天尤人，只会阻止自己前进的脚步。", "reviewId": "66920859_84hT88c8R", "commentId": "66920859_84hT88c8R_c14858216_85SkEI06R", "userVid": 14858216, "createTime": 1767415055, "likesCount": 1, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 14858216, "name": "争渡", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/dWiaEmetACAHy2KBAkrBCe0aXXfHxDYx4sjRJxibFRebs/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "争渡", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "哲学,文学,心理学,经济,投资", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, {"content": "严谨一点，打工的收入比种地强。生活不一定比种地强。😂", "reviewId": "66920859_84hT88c8R", "commentId": "66920859_84hT88c8R_c14858216_85SewEB3c", "userVid": 14858216, "createTime": 1767409439, "author": {"userVid": 14858216, 